# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# Runtime user media — NEVER commit. The running app writes guest photos, live
# galleries and wedding uploads here; they belong on disk / S3, not in git
# (privacy + repo bloat). This stops `git add -A` on the server from sweeping
# them in. (A few legacy files under uploads/ were committed before this rule
# and remain tracked; untrack them separately if desired.)
uploads/

# Camera daemon runtime — the persisted SFTP host key + FTPES TLS cert/key
# (secrets), and the per-connection upload scratch dirs.
backend/.camera_sftp_host_key
backend/.camera_tmp/
backend/.camera_ftps_cert.pem
backend/.camera_ftps_key.pem
backend/.camera_ftps_tmp/

